      178  The total population of Somalia according to the 1987 census was 7,114,431 .
      179  (2005) UN Development Programme (web).
      180  (2014) UN Population Fund (web). The population estimation survey 2014 was carried out by the Somali authorities from October 2013 to March 2014. The total population consists of an urban population of 5,216,392, of a rural population of 2,806,787, of 3,186,965 nomads and of 1,106,751 IDPs (internally displaced persons).
      181  (2019) OCHA Somalia Information Management Working Group.
